(distinct (list ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] (drop ["y" "abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] 1) ["a"] ["a"])) -- (list ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] ["a"])
(distinct (Z (list ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] (drop ["y" "abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] 1) ["a"] ["a"]))) -- (list ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] ["a"])
