(in (list ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] ["a"]) (Z (list ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] (drop ["y" "abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] 1) ["a"] ["a"]))) -- (list [false false] [false])
(except (list ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] (drop ["y" "abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] 1) ["a"] ["a"]) (list ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] ["a"])) -- ()
(except (list ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] (drop ["y" "abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] 1) ["a"] ["a"]) (Z (list ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] ["a"]))) -- ()
(except (list ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] ["a"]) (Z (list ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] ["abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] (drop ["y" "abcdefghijklmnopq" "x"] 1) ["a"] ["a"]))) -- ()
